        "official_en_sha256": "026976abea012a4e6607e67ba13ee5f3df9b59727f95363cd7483cd922f85716"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それじゃ、アタシは\r\n飛空艇を仕上げてくるから。",
        "official_en": "All right. I just need to apply a few final touches to the airship.",
        "real_en": "All right, I’m going to finish the airship."
