        "official_en_sha256": "9d846c79b3c3324f0f2bd5c899c51b220cb1a1b576053a38ae0bd016bdcc9208"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "でも、記憶がなくたって大丈夫。\r\n私、毎日がすごく楽しいし。",
        "official_en": "But that’s all right. I’m happy enough as it is.",
        "real_en": "But I’ll be okay even without my memories. I’m having so much fun every day."
      },
      "review": {
