        "official_en_sha256": "d6f549c88e9ad9be55da2111ab0b07be2c8717e95cedd12d0641f3547131da40"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "もうすぐ飛空艇に乗れるんだよね。\r\n空を飛ぶのってどんな感じなのかな。",
        "official_en": "We’re gonna get to ride on that airship soon, huh? I wonder what it’s like to fly up there?",
        "real_en": null
