        "official_en_sha256": "fe682a2ebd7a60b63adae8bc33b61b09f04dd5d70b715bfcc799ba97e1ae334a"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "初めての飛空艇か。\r\nきっといい思い出になるぞ。",
        "official_en": "Ah, it’s your first trip? You’ll remember it for the rest of your life, I’m sure.",
        "real_en": "Your first time on an airship, huh? I’m sure it’ll be a great memory."
      },
