        "official_en_sha256": "662f38365e2599de93bb035b616369e9da49437f1b0adcd5aafc5035b11a42af"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "各地の神殿に向かうために\r\n飛空艇が必要だったんじゃないのか？",
        "official_en": "Maybe he needed an airship to travel between the shrines.",
        "real_en": "Didn’t he need an airship to reach the shrines in different places?"
      },
      "review": {
